flowchart TD
    START([Incident or failure question]) --> ORCH{Driven by sre-incident-lifecycle?}
    ORCH -- yes --> FRAME
    ORCH -- no --> FRAME
    FRAME[1 Frame problem - rca-investigation] --> ACTIVE{Impact active and critical?}
    ACTIVE -- yes --> MITIG[Focus on mitigation - evidence stays provisional]
    MITIG --> LIVE[[incident-live-report - Investigation section]]
    MITIG --> INTAKEQ
    ACTIVE -- no --> INTAKEQ{Evidence needs conversion or coverage checks?}
    INTAKEQ -- yes --> INV[Run evidence_inventory once - coordinator]
    INV --> FANOUT1{{Fan-out intake workers - Agent tool}}
    FANOUT1 --> IW1[Intake worker A - parse_logs]
    FANOUT1 --> IW2[Intake worker B - inspect_capture]
    IW1 --> MERGE1[Coordinator merges manifest and coverage]
    IW2 --> MERGE1
    INTAKEQ -- no --> TL
    MERGE1 --> PREPONLY{Evidence prep only?}
    PREPONLY -- yes --> HANDOFF([Deliver intake bundle - no causal claims])
    PREPONLY -- no --> TL
    TL[2 Causal timeline - rca-investigation] --> FANOUT2{{Fan-out evidence-source analysts}}
    FANOUT2 --> EA1[App logs analyst]
    FANOUT2 --> EA2[DB or network analyst]
    FANOUT2 --> EA3[Change-history analyst]
    EA1 --> LEDGER
    EA2 --> LEDGER
    EA3 --> LEDGER
    LEDGER[3 Evidence ledger - coordinator only writes] --> SNAP[(Publish snapshot vN)]
    SNAP --> HYP[4 Ranked falsifiable hypotheses]
    HYP --> HW{{Optional hypothesis workers - generate or challenge}}
    HW --> HYP2[Coordinator ranks by evidence fit]
    HYP2 --> TEST[5 Design discriminating test]
    TEST --> PRODCHG{Test changes production?}
    PRODCHG -- yes --> APPROVE{User approves with risk and rollback?}
    APPROVE -- no --> PLAN[Ordered test plan only]
    APPROVE -- yes --> RUN[Run test and post-check]
    PRODCHG -- no --> RUN
    RUN --> UPD[Record result, update ledger, re-rank]
    PLAN --> UPD
    UPD --> SNAP
    UPD --> TRK{Issue tracking active?}
    TRK -- yes --> TW[Tracker worker - single writer per ticket]
    TW --> CONN{Tracker connector available?}
    CONN -- yes --> PUB[Linear or Jira or GitHub update]
    CONN -- no --> DRAFT[Portable draft]
    TRK -- no --> GATE
    UPD --> GATE{6 Causality gate met?}
    GATE -- no, tests remain --> TEST
    GATE -- no, no safe test --> NC[root cause not confirmed plus gaps]
    GATE -- candidate --> REV{{Independent reviewer subagent}}
    REV --> CONF[Confirmed or strongly supported]
    CONF --> CODEQ{Defect localized to accessible code and fix wanted?}
    CODEQ -- yes --> DEBUG[7 engineering:debug reproduce isolate fix regression test]
    DEBUG --> REGATE[Results back to ledger, re-apply gate]
    REGATE --> OUT
    CODEQ -- no --> OUT
    NC --> OUT
    OUT[RCA output - rca-investigation] --> PM[[incident-postmortem]]
    OUT --> EMAIL[[tech-email]]
    OUT --> LIVE
    DEBUG -. deploy asked .-> DEPLOY[[engineering:deploy-checklist]]
